# Environment variables for Health Cloud
#
# Copy this file to .env for local development:
#   cp .env.example .env
# Then fill in the real values below.
#
# IMPORTANT for production hosting (Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, Netlify, etc.):
# these are Vite env vars, which means they are baked into the JavaScript
# bundle AT BUILD TIME, not read at runtime. Setting them in your host's
# dashboard is not enough by itself -- you must also trigger a fresh
# build/deploy afterward for them to actually take effect. Forgetting
# either the URL/key or the rebuild is exactly what causes the app to
# crash immediately with "Uncaught Error: supabaseUrl is required."
#
# Never commit a real .env file -- it's already covered by .gitignore.
# This .env.example file should only ever contain placeholder values.

# ---------- Required — the app will not start without these ----------

# Find both of these in your Supabase project: Project Settings > API.
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the public "anon" key, safe to expose in a
# browser bundle. NEVER use the "service_role" key here -- that key
# bypasses Row Level Security entirely and must only ever be used
# server-side (Edge Functions), never shipped to the client.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# ---------- Optional — the app works fine without these ----------

# Error monitoring (Sentry). Leave unset to disable entirely -- no
# account is created or contacted unless this is set to a real DSN.
# Get one by creating a project at https://sentry.io.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxxxxxx@oXXXXXX.ingest.sentry.io/XXXXXXX

# ---------- Configured elsewhere, not here ----------
#
# Everything below is set as Supabase Edge Function *secrets*
# (`supabase secrets set KEY=value`), not as a Vite env var here --
# these are server-side only and must never be prefixed with VITE_ or
# they would end up shipped to every visitor's browser.
#
#   FLUTTERWAVE_SECRET_KEY, FLUTTERWAVE_WEBHOOK_SECRET   (payments)
#   TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID, TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN, TWILIO_FROM,
#   TWILIO_WHATSAPP_FROM, TWILIO_WHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_SID     (reminders)
#
# See each function's header comment in supabase/functions/ for the
# exact setup steps (supabase/functions/flutterwave-initiate/index.ts,
# supabase/functions/send-appointment-reminders/index.ts).
